              "type": "code",
              "lang": "c",
              "code": "char nom[16] = \"Ada\";\nprintf(\"%zu\\n\", strlen(nom));\nstrncpy(dest, src, sizeof(dest) - 1);\ndest[sizeof(dest) - 1] = '\\0';",
